e direct decisions on the terrain, such as tactics or engaging enemies. \r\nThe game offers five different scenarios: Khe Sanh, Tet Offensive, 1975 offensive, Nixon and Johnson. The first three are some of the most decisive battles during the conflict, whereas choosing &quot;Nixon&quot; or &quot;Johnson&quot; changes the year (1964 or 1968) in which the player starts playing.","year":1991,"genre":["Strategy/Tactics"],"cat":"MS-DOS","categoryType":"game","console":"msdos","origem":"MS-DOS","id":"DOS_1NJFXDIPK0"}}